<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 606 MLN POLISH FIXED BONDS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 606 MLN POLISH FIXED BONDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 249 million zlotys of 15-percent two-year fixed bonds and for 357 million zlotys of 12-percent five-year bonds at the Treasury's joint 800 million zloty tender, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
